{"id":"msg_m_ex_naga_02","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_naga","label":"Naga · Nikke"},"label":"2. Teacher,","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_naga_01","next":"msg_m_ex_naga_03","speakers":{"naga":"Naga"},"icons":{"naga":"si_c450_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_naga_02_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_naga_02_1","text":"Teacher,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_naga_02_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_naga_02_2","text":"have you ever considered getting your ears pierced?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_naga_02_3","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_naga_02_3","text":"Never.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_naga_02_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_naga_02_4","text":"That's too bad :(","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_naga_02_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_naga_02_5","text":"What about a ring","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_naga_02_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_naga_02_6","text":"or perhaps a bracelet?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_naga_02_7","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_naga_02_7","text":"No, they'd probably just get in the way.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_naga_02_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_naga_02_8","text":"Hmm...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_naga_02_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_naga_02_9","text":"How about...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_naga_02_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_naga_02_10","text":"Necklaces?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_naga_02_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_naga_02_11","text":"Watches?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_naga_02_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_naga_02_12","text":"Keychains?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_naga_02_13","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_naga_02_13","text":"No, they're not for me.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_naga_02_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_naga_02_14","text":"Oh... I see.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_naga_02_15","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_naga_02_15","text":"Why do you ask?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_naga_02_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_naga_02_16","text":"Oh, it's nothing.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_naga_02_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_naga_02_17","text":"It's just that I found something in an alley today.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_naga_02_18","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_naga_02_18","text":"What?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_naga_02_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_naga_02_19","text":"I saw a signless store that seemed rather suspicious,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_naga_02_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_naga_02_20","text":"but once I went inside, I noticed that there were loads of pretty things.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_naga_02_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_naga_02_21","text":"So I thought of getting one for you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_naga_02_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_naga_02_22","text":"It's too bad you're not into that kind of thing.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_naga_02_23","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_naga_02_23","text":"What kind of store was it?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_naga_02_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_naga_02_24","text":"Hehe, it's obviously an accessories shop!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_naga_02_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_naga_02_25","text":"There were all sorts of cool stuff in there.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_naga_02_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_naga_02_26","text":"Ugh, what should I do?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_naga_02_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_naga_02_27","text":"I was planning on saving up this month,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_naga_02_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_naga_02_28","text":"but now I'm not so sure.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_naga_02_29","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_naga_02_29","text":"When it comes to these things, you seem more like someone your age.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_naga_02_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_naga_02_30","text":"Eh?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_naga_02_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_naga_02_31","text":"Are you implying that","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_naga_02_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_naga_02_32","text":"I'm not acting my age?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_naga_02_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_naga_02_33","text":"Is that","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_naga_02_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_naga_02_34","text":"what you're saying?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_naga_02_35","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_naga_02_35","text":"I'm just saying you appear more mature than your actual age.","jump":"m_ex_naga_02_37"},{"id":"m_ex_naga_02_36","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_naga_02_36","text":"I'm just saying you appear younger than your actual age.","jump":"m_ex_naga_02_40"},{"id":"m_ex_naga_02_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_naga_02_37","text":"Oh, Teacher,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_naga_02_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_naga_02_38","text":"you've no idea what you've just done.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_naga_02_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_naga_02_39","text":"Your words will be etched in my memory forever.","jump":"m_ex_naga_02_44"},{"id":"m_ex_naga_02_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_naga_02_40","text":"Oh, right.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_naga_02_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_naga_02_41","text":"That's what you meant.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_naga_02_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_naga_02_42","text":"I thought you had something else in mind.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_naga_02_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_naga_02_43","text":"Thank you, Teacher! Hehe.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_naga_02_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_naga_02_44","text":"Teacher,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_naga_02_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_naga_02_45","text":"I know that I've been in your hair as of late,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_naga_02_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_naga_02_46","text":"so I'd like to give you a thank-you gift for everything you've done.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_naga_02_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_naga_02_47","text":"You don't have to wear it,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_naga_02_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_naga_02_48","text":"but I hope that you'll accept","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_naga_02_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_naga_02_49","text":"a token of my gratitude.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_naga_02_50","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_naga_02_50","text":"Of course, you can always get me a necklace.","jump":"m_ex_naga_02_52"},{"id":"m_ex_naga_02_51","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_naga_02_51","text":"Of course, you can always get me a watch.","jump":"m_ex_naga_02_52"},{"id":"m_ex_naga_02_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_naga_02_52","text":"I figured you'd say that,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_naga_02_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_naga_02_53","text":"so I'll choose something that catches my eyes.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_naga_02_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_naga_02_54","text":"See you in the Commander's Room later","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_naga_02_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_naga_02_55","text":"and brace yourself for a surprise when I arrive!","jump":null}],"chat":true}